## Changelog
### Version 2.0 – Part 2
- Fixed the external stylesheet path and organised CSS under the css folder.
- Added CSS reset, colour variables, typography and consistent spacing.
- Added Flexbox navigation and active page states.
- Added hover, focus-visible and active pseudo-classes.
- Added CSS Grid for desktop content and single-column tablet/mobile layouts.
- Added relative units and responsive typography.
- Added responsive image markup using picture, srcset and sizes.
- Improved forms, buttons and map responsiveness.
- Added responsive breakpoints for tablet, mobile and small phones.
- Updated README documentation for Part 2.

### Version 1.0 – Part 1
- Created the five HTML pages, navigation, forms, contact information, initial CSS and README.

